In effect, this means scrolls are 20% less common in regular Chambers of Xeric, and 26% less common in Challenge Mode Chambers of Xeric, which puts it closer to how the Avernic defender hilt in terms of its relative weighting.

We'll be keeping an ''extremely'' close eye on these, but appreciate that values, prices and in-game markets around major changes can shift wildly and take some time to settle down, so we won't make any immediate tweaks unless something is miles out of line. If things aren't landing where we'd like, then we will leave further tweaks on the table and revisit these changes to bring them more in line with our aims!

